        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-FPGA-BEYOND-730.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-730-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH731-EXP-PROC-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH732-ISA-DECODE-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH733-PROC-LAT-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH734-735M-SAAT-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
